5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so happy to help pick something new for our library. I want to make sure whatever we choose actually works for the people who need it!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, Yumi. However, enthusiasm is a poor substitute for evidence. I suspect we would benefit from revisiting the ghosts of our past initiatives.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I agree with Benjamin. Logic should lead. I'm interested in whether we actually have the capacity to manage a new service without just overloading the current staff.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,It is important to be thorough. I believe we should examine how our funding is structured to ensure the project remains viable beyond the first year.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to make sure we aren't forgetting the people who live far away. I wonder if the location of our services is a problem.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that's so thoughtful! I'll look into the roads and the buses to see how people are getting around. We can't let them be left out!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the records of previous programs. It would be a tragedy to repeat a failure simply because the documentation was gathering dust.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will check the volunteer register and the tool certifications. We need to know if the necessary skills are actually present on our roster.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the grant terms and the equipment lines from last year. We need a clear picture of the financial flow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Yumi. I'll look into the bus links and the old outreach attendance sheets to see where the demand really is.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I think I'm set! I'll check the winter road closures and the bus links. Let's find a way to reach everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look into the evening room bookings. It is often the quiet hours that reveal the true gaps in our service.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll add the neighbourhood associations to my list. I want to see how much external support we can actually rely on.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I believe my choices are sufficient. I will stick with the grant terms and the running and equipment lines.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll stick with the bus links and the attendance sheets. I hope this helps us make a fair choice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
